# Photon Project Rules

## UI Framework
- **WPF-UI will NOT be used** in any Photon projects (Nodus, Imago, Lumen)
- Use standard WPF with custom theming and controls
- Use CommunityToolkit.Mvvm for MVVM patterns (ObservableObject, RelayCommand, etc.)
- When importing from `previous-dev/`, remove WPF-UI dependencies and replace with standard WPF equivalents

## Project Structure
- Monorepo structure: `src/Photon.Core` (shared), `src/Nodus.UI`, `src/Imago.UI`, `src/Lumen.UI`
- Unified solution: `ProjectPhoton.sln`
- Standards folder: `standards/` (nodus.md, imago.md, lumen.md, shared.md)
- Always read relevant TODO.md and standards files before making changes
